				{
					"id": 730560602,
					"content": "#對了，如果不介意的話…雖然不是什麼貴重的東西。這個給{F#妳}{M#你}們，留作紀念吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730560603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "海亞姆"
				},
				{
					"id": 730560603,
					"content": "哇…是什麼呀？是什麼呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730560604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730560604,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們應該見過，這朵風乾的小花。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730560605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "海亞姆"
				},
				{
					"id": 730560605,
					"content": "欸——！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730560606,
						730560607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730560606,
					"content": "這是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730560608
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730560608,
					"content": "#沒錯。而如果我沒有猜錯的話…他們也一定給了{F#妳}{M#你}同樣的禮物吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730560609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "海亞姆"
				},
				{
					"id": 730560609,
					"content": "呵呵…我就知道，我們的相遇不是單純的巧合…我從不相信巧合這種事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730560610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "海亞姆"
				},
				{
					"id": 730560610,
					"content": "#這朵花就交給{F#妳}{M#你}了。拜託{F#妳}{M#你}，交給我們共同的朋友吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730560611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "海亞姆"
				},
				{
					"id": 730560611,
					"content": "嗯，可以是可以啦，只是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730560612,
						730560614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730560612,
					"content": "他們應該不記得我了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730560613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730560613,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730560615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "海亞姆"
				},
				{
					"id": 730560615,
					"content": "我也看不到他們了啊…我甚至無法相信，他們真的存在，還是說…僅僅是我的童年幻想而已…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730560616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "海亞姆"
				},
				{
					"id": 730560616,
					"content": "#但我還是要堅持。孩子們，把這個交給他們吧…趁{F#妳}{M#你}還能遇到他們，趁奇蹟還有發生的可能。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "海亞姆"
				},
				{
					"id": 730560614,
					"content": "他們可能不記得你了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730560615
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730560607,
					"content": "蘭那羅們…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730560608
					]
				}
			]
		},
