					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730560727,
					"content": "唉……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730560729
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730560729,
					"content": "#但是，謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}們。我的園地，如果還記得，{F#妳}{M#你}們。請{F#妳}{M#你}們來吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730560730
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭納迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730560730,
					"content": "很重要的花，會種下，蘭納迦。",
